abstract: Fifteen multilingual, offline-ready interactive AI labs spanning thirteen Foundations/course-track mechanisms and two Modern AI extensions. v1.6.2 is a narrow public-provenance hotfix over v1.6.1: it normalizes current-version labels and analytics provenance in the exact generated Pages artifact without changing algorithms, curriculum, or assignment behavior.
